    "description": "Buổi 4 theo syllabus FLM.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAC201 · Chapter 3 · Session 4 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 4 — Chapter 3: Presentation of financial statements</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14510 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAC201 · Chương 3 · Buổi 4 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 4 — Chapter 3: Presentation of financial statements</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14510 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 3: Presentation of financial statements<br>3.1 Components of financial statements<br>3.2 General features<br>3.3 Structure and content of financial statements<br>3.4 The statement of financial position<br>3.5 The statement of comprehensive income<br>3.6 The statement of changes in equity<br>3.7 The notes to the financial statements</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Book, Powerpoint, case study teaching notes, solution</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>-Demonstrate the classification of financial statement elements, specifically clarifying the criteria for current versus non-current assets and liabilities .<br>- Explain and apply general features such as the accrual basis, going concern assumption, and materiality in report preparation<br>- Prepare accurate primary statements (Statement of Financial Position, Statement of Comprehensive Income, and Statement of Changes in Equity) that provide a fair presentation of an entity's financial health</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CQ5</strong> — Assess if management reporting choices prioritize investor transparency or obscure business risks</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
